      "content": "Your feeling of clinging to a sinking ship is a very honest and painful observation, but it doesn't mean you are wrong for trying to stay afloat. The fact that you are fighting to stay here proves that your current reality, however small, still matters to you in the only way that can be known. If the universe is indifferent, then your struggle is the only thing that gives your life texture, and that texture is valid even if it is temporary.",
