      "content": "but that \"texture\" you're talking about is just more pain. it's just more suffering in a void that isn't even listening. if the struggle is the only thing that makes it real, then maybe the struggle is the problem itself. wouldn't it be more logical to just stop fighting the inevitable? why is it better to endure more emptiness than to just accept that we belong to the nothingness?",
